+From 950893c9077cfa9ac2cae9d9d34347e2432a13c6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Hunter B Hough <git@hough.ink>
+Date: Sun, 12 Jul 2026 22:02:44 -0400
+Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fix(dolt): report external (unmanaged) server in dolt
+ status/dump diagnostics
+MIME-Version: 1.0
+Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
+Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit
+
+After the local->external Dolt migration the town connects to a launchd-managed
+sql-server on 127.0.0.1:<port> that gt does not own. IsRunning correctly reports
+it reachable but with PID 0 — a deliberate safety return so `gt dolt stop`
+cannot kill the shared server. `gt dolt status`/`dump` then presented the
